{
  "info": {
    "name": "Payroll Periods API",
    "_postman_id": "payroll-periods-collection-v1",
    "description": "All endpoints for managing payroll periods scoped under /api/companies/:company_id/payroll-periods\n\n---\n\n### Updated status lifecycle\n\n```\nopen → processing → pending_approval → approved → completed → locked\n```\n\n`pending_approval` and `approved` are new — the period now mirrors the payroll run driving it. A rejection drops it back to `processing`.\n\n> The run is the authority: `POST /payroll-runs` creates a period inline, and the flow advances this status as each step lands. Prefer that over driving period status by hand.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:4000/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "company_id",
      "value": "a1b2c3d4-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
    },
    {
      "key": "period_id",
      "value": "a1b2c3d4-0000-0000-0000-000000000099"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "your_jwt_token_here"
    }
  ],
