          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"processing\"\n}"
        },
        "description": "**Role:** `isManager`\n\nAllowed transitions:\n\n```\nopen             → processing\nprocessing       → pending_approval | approved | completed | open\npending_approval → approved | processing      (rejection drops back)\napproved         → completed | processing\ncompleted        → locked\nlocked           → (terminal)\n```"
      },
